{"__lines":{"Everyone in Caldris is born owing. The world was made from the body of a god, the Giver, and every soul must pay back what it is made of. That payment is the Tithe.":"in_n2","You pay it in pages. Every soul carries a Sheaf, its unlived days written down. Burn a page and you get power: a spell, a blade, a beast at your side. That day is gone. You will never live it, or remember it.":"in_n3","Even people who want nothing pay. Every year the Archfiend\u2019s collectors take their share of every Sheaf. When the pages run out, a soul is spent, and the Gates of Hades open for it.":"in_n4","Tonight you swear the Hunter\u2019s oath. Every new Hunter feeds one page to the Lodge fire. Yours lies in the flames, white and cool, and will not burn.":"in_n5","Huh. Pages always burn. Everybody\u2019s burns.":"in_i0","That page isn\u2019t really yours. It\u2019s a torn corner of the First Page, the one the Giver meant to write the world on. Your name isn\u2019t in the Ledger at all.":"in_i2","Behind the Astral Gate is the First Page. Whatever is written there, the whole world has to obey. Five Relics open the Gate.":"in_i3","I want one line on it: \u201cNothing is owed.\u201d No more Tithe. Nobody burns their days just to stay alive. But only a hand that holds a piece of the Page can write. Yours.":"in_i4","Last night the Grand Orrery stopped ticking for a whole minute. The Relics are drifting into line. And far to the south, under the Cinder Throne, something that has slept since the Gate was broken opens its eyes.":"in_n6","That\u2019s the Archfiend. It wants every debt in Caldris collected before anyone can leave, and it will want your page most of all.":"in_i5","Every Relic has a guardian, and guardians don\u2019t take bribes. They take duels. I read the maps, you do the fighting. Deal?":"in_i6","Your first trial waits in the Tidewood. Tap a glowing place on the map, then Travel.":"in_n7"},"st_hr_intro_0":"img/x/bac0e1ecb8cee2fb.mp3","in_n2":"img/x/a0fde393e2465153.mp3","in_n3":"img/x/699d1a5fbb50fb69.mp3","in_n4":"img/x/8179998ca767704f.mp3","in_n5":"img/x/76fbd9530229e4bd.mp3","in_i0":"img/x/44606d476fe02322.mp3","in_i2":"img/x/259c09cf80fe4a07.mp3","in_i3":"img/x/c5487b1dfe77846c.mp3","in_i4":"img/x/226fbb3987a3438c.mp3","in_n6":"img/x/c7cd75f508bec7ab.mp3","in_i5":"img/x/6bf0276d53f46bbe.mp3","in_i6":"img/x/dfbe168e86f365d8.mp3","in_n7":"img/x/586efc172465954d.mp3","st_prologue_0":"img/x/db6bd31f4b3c662a.mp3","st_prologue_1":"img/x/36d28bc2d992f96b.mp3"}